yer's turn. The AI's version of using a Full Restore combines both of these observations. Why does this happen? The cause is that, unlike what is done in the core battle engine, the function DrawEnemyHUDAndHPBar never gets run when executing the AI item functions.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:26:28Z", "repo": "Pokemon_Celebrations", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b1ae9383d19ef15ff47286c270ade08b17c689c8", "message": "Update Yellow/GBC Code\n\nCredit: Jojobear/ShinPokeRed", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:20:53Z", "repo": "Pokemon_Celebrations", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3c574ac551fa9edd52b628e32681d2655869e270", "message": "Remove UnusedPartyMonSpriteFunction", "created_at": "2025-10-21T12:48:50Z", "repo": "Pokemon_Celebrations", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "18f1aedad1237f152e5b10eb109cc19571e931aa", "message": "Fix HP Bar Not Being Full For Opponent On Hard Mode", "created_at": "2025-10-21T12:37:57Z", "repo": "Pokemon_Celebrations", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f3ceba3bb6914e9c614a80717dad9ea278dd7d48", "message": "Remove Unused Critical Hit Moves", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:47:32Z", "repo": "Pokemon_Celebrations", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c8c46c2bedc7eea3a00b602948bcb0ebdf92a6e6", "message": "Remove Unused Code Battle Animation\n\nAlso Bank1E", "created_at": "2025-10-20T00:30:36Z", "repo": "Pokemon_Celebrations", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3a1a6049dcc57af23cab6eaa1fa6734ab2b82218", "message": "Cleaned Up All Sprite Labels\n\nDone Incorrectly and Rushed by DarthBR previously. Fixed now.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T23:35:08Z", "repo": "Pokemon_Celebrations", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "797a388ef3c93a1bdaf016795ef